This module teaches a workflow, not a superpower: the model drafts fast and is wrong with confidence, and no prompting technique removes the need to run code. Model capabilities and interfaces change fast — treat specific tools as of 2026-10-07 and the verification discipline as the durable part. It confers no certificate, and 'AI-assisted' on a résumé means nothing without the test suites to prove the discipline.

