Produce an EDA report on a tabular dataset I provide (it contains a planted leak, a mislabeled segment, and a skewed feature — you don't get told which). Deliverable: a single document with plots and takeaways that (1) describes data health, (2) identifies the leak with a feature-vs-target plot and an explanation of why it's leakage, (3) flags the mislabeled segment, and (4) states how each finding changes the modeling plan. Grading bar: miss the leak and the report fails — a model trained on it would report fantasy metrics. Every chart needs labeled axes, units, and a takeaway title.

