Plots persuade, which is exactly why this module stresses honesty: a chart can lie faster than a paragraph, and 'the data speaks for itself' is how truncated axes ship. Visualization finds problems; it doesn't fix them — every insight here must be verified in the data, not just admired in the figure. No certificate is conferred; the skill is the audit habit.

