SQL is a tool, not a worldview: it's the right instrument for structured questions over structured data, and the wrong one for unstructured text or iterative algorithms. DuckDB specifics here are as of 2026-10-07 — syntax authority stays with its public docs. This module confers no certificate; the durable skill is the validation habit — no dataset becomes training data without passing the gate.

