Supervised learning is powerful and narrow: it interpolates within the training distribution and has no opinion outside it. More complex models don't beat baselines by default — the shootout exists because hope is not a selection strategy. This module confers no certificate; the durable skill is the evaluation discipline, which the next modules deepen.

