Customer-segmentation report on a dataset I provide: cluster with at least two methods, choose cluster counts with documented reasoning, validate with stability checks and any available external labels, and deliver segment profiles (who is in each cluster, in plain business language) plus a limitations section. Grading bar: the report must state, for each method, what would prove the clusters wrong — a segmentation with no falsification criterion is storytelling, and it fails.

