Training-workflow deliverable: a complete, device-agnostic training script for an image or tabular task with Dataset/DataLoader, the hand-written loop, full checkpointing with resume, gradient accumulation, and optional AMP — plus a runbook README (how to train, how to resume, expected curves, GPU-memory requirements). Grading bar: I kill your run at epoch 3 and resume from the checkpoint — the loss trajectory must continue, not restart. Any hardcoded 'cuda' without fallback fails device discipline.

