GANs and VAEs are taught for literacy, not as the state of the art — diffusion models dominate image generation now, and this module won't make you a generative-model researcher. The durable value is the conceptual toolkit (distributions, latent spaces, adversarial dynamics) and the skepticism their failure modes teach. No certificate is conferred.

