Alignment analysis report: take a preference dataset I provide (with planted noisy/ambiguous pairs), train a toy reward model or DPO objective, and deliver the preference-loss derivation, training curves with KL tracking, a reward-hacking stress test (optimize against your proxy and document the degradation), and an evaluation plan covering the blind spots of your own eval. Grading bar: the report must show at least one hacking instance you induced — an alignment report with no observed failure mode hasn't looked.

