Classical NLP is largely superseded for state-of-the-art results — this module teaches it for baselines, literacy, and the tasks where simple still wins, not as the modern default. The inspectability lesson transfers everywhere: prefer systems you can debug. No certificate is conferred; the durable skill is the baseline habit.

