The hub is a marketplace, not a vetting service — cards vary in quality, 'latest' isn't reproducible, and licenses have teeth. pipeline() baselines are honest starting points, not solutions. Library specifics are as of 2026-10-07. No certificate is conferred; the durable habits are the baseline discipline and reading before downloading.

