notes.body:
Tool-suite deliverable: a set of 5+ contracted tools for a domain I specify, with complete schemas, idempotency markings, human gates on irreversible actions, least-privilege audit (threat sentence per tool), failure-handling tests (timeout/bad-args/downstream), and a prompt-injection test showing tool-output instructions being treated as data. Grading bar: any irreversible tool without a gate fails — and the injection test must demonstrate the defense working, not just describe it.

