Principles don't implement themselves — 'responsible AI' is testing, documentation, oversight, and governance work, not a badge. Fairness has competing definitions; the honest practice names which one you're using. Exam prep as of 2026-10-07; Microsoft's standard evolves. No certificate is conferred here — the exam is Microsoft's.

