Serving deliverable: a containerized model behind an API with the packaging reproducible from scratch, REST (or gRPC with rationale), load-test report with p50/p99 and the batch-size knee analysis, batch inference path with cost comparison, progressive-delivery plan (shadow → canary gates), and SLO definitions with alerting. Grading bar: unmeasured latency claims fail — and any deployment plan without a rollback path fails with them.

