Cost optimization without measurement is superstition — the anatomy comes first, always. Quantization quality tradeoffs are workload-specific; vendor numbers are starting points. Cloud pricing moves; the method (decompose, attack the dominant term) doesn't. No certificate is conferred; the durable skill is unit economics thinking.

