Evaluation is approximate: judges are biased, humans are inconsistent, code checks are blind to quality — triangulation is the honesty strategy. Golden sets rot as tasks evolve; maintain them. This module confers no certificate; the durable discipline is the controlled experiment: one variable, measured gain, or no claim.

