Data-centric doesn't mean model-agnostic — architecture still matters, and 'just fix the data' can become an excuse to avoid necessary modeling work. Synthetic data is a supplement with validation, not a replacement for real data. This module confers no certificate; the durable habit is the audit-first reflex: suspect the data before the model.

