MLOps lite is real MLOps at appropriate scale — not a toy version, but the discipline without the platform team. Demo reliability is the bar: a portfolio piece that 500s on click is worse than no demo. Serving costs are real even for demos; budget them. No certificate is conferred; the product is a live system.

