The portfolio is judged in ten minutes — design for that window, not for completeness theater. Honest limits beat inflated claims: managers hire judgment, not just results. Attribution clarity matters: what's yours vs library code, stated plainly. No certificate is conferred; the product is the career asset the whole path built toward.

